# fixedbugs, defect 478, lane b15-emit, 2026-10-08 (lane b14-ir's reading).
# Symptom: the emitted prologue asked of every slot whether it was one of the
# function's parameters by walking every parameter, the shape defect 230
# removed from the ownership pass: a cost of the parameters times the slots,
# 88 of 995 samples on a function of 3,200 parameters.
# Cause: `emit/body.hero`'s prologue, one loop over `f.params` per slot.
# Now the parameters are one set, made once.
#
# The shape: forty plain parameters interleaved with forty `@` strings, and a
# local between every pair, so the prologue meets a parameter, a local and an
# `@` place in every order the loop has a branch for. The program's output is
# the sum its own arithmetic gives: every `a` is its index plus one, every
# local one more, every `@` string two bytes long once it has grown.

function mix(a0: i64, @b0: str, a1: i64, @b1: str, a2: i64, @b2: str, a3: i64, @b3: str, a4: i64, @b4: str, a5: i64, @b5: str, a6: i64, @b6: str, a7: i64, @b7: str, a8: i64, @b8: str, a9: i64, @b9: str, a10: i64, @b10: str, a11: i64, @b11: str, a12: i64, @b12: str, a13: i64, @b13: str, a14: i64, @b14: str, a15: i64, @b15: str, a16: i64, @b16: str, a17: i64, @b17: str, a18: i64, @b18: str, a19: i64, @b19: str, a20: i64, @b20: str, a21: i64, @b21: str, a22: i64, @b22: str, a23: i64, @b23: str, a24: i64, @b24: str, a25: i64, @b25: str, a26: i64, @b26: str, a27: i64, @b27: str, a28: i64, @b28: str, a29: i64, @b29: str, a30: i64, @b30: str, a31: i64, @b31: str, a32: i64, @b32: str, a33: i64, @b33: str, a34: i64, @b34: str, a35: i64, @b35: str, a36: i64, @b36: str, a37: i64, @b37: str, a38: i64, @b38: str, a39: i64, @b39: str) -> i64
    total: i64 @= 0
    l0 = a0 + 1
    b0 @ b0 + "!"
    total @ total + a0 + l0 + b0.len()
    l1 = a1 + 1
    b1 @ b1 + "!"
    total @ total + a1 + l1 + b1.len()
